---
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
import { WifiOff, FileCheck, Lock, Zap } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<Section id="trust">
  <div class="mx-auto mb-20 max-w-3xl md:text-center">
    <h2 class="mb-6 font-serif text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-balance">
      Tecnología robusta
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground text-balance">
      Construido con los estándares más altos. Seguridad, velocidad y fiabilidad.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border/50 bg-card/30 p-8 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-basil/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-basil/10 flex items-center justify-center text-basil mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                  <WifiOff class="w-6 h-6" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-medium mb-3">Offline-First Engine</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                  Tu restaurante nunca se detiene. Sincronización transparente con local-first databases (IndexedDB). Si cae internet, sigues vendiendo.
              </p>
          </div>
      </div>

       <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border/50 bg-card/30 p-8 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-blueberry/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blueberry/10 flex items-center justify-center text-blueberry mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                  <FileCheck class="w-6 h-6" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-medium mb-3">Verifactu Ready</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                  Cumplimiento total normativa antifraude y Ley Crea y Crece. Facturación electrónica certificada y sellado de tiempo inmutable.
              </p>
          </div>
      </div>

       <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border/50 bg-card/30 p-8 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-espresso/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-espresso/10 flex items-center justify-center text-espresso mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                  <Lock class="w-6 h-6" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-medium mb-3">Enterprise Security</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                  Aislamiento de datos con Row-Level Security (RLS) en PostgreSQL. Tus datos están encriptados y seguros a nivel de base de datos.
              </p>
          </div>
      </div>

       <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border/50 bg-card/30 p-8 hover:bg-card hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-tomato/5 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-tomato/10 flex items-center justify-center text-tomato mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                  <Zap class="w-6 h-6" />
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-medium mb-3">Optimistic UI</h3>
              <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
                  Latencia cero en percepción. La interfaz responde instantáneamente mientras sincroniza en segundo plano. Sensación nativa fluida.
              </p>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</Section>
